Weather Widget Lottie - Deployment
====================================

Copy these files to your ESP32 SD card:

  /sdcard/weather/weather_widget.json    (the Lottie animation)
  /sdcard/weather/SFProDisplay-Regular.ttf  (font for text rendering)

The Lottie animation contains all weather icons, text slots,
and gradient backgrounds in a single file. ThorVG's slot override
API is used to update text, switch icons, and change colors at runtime.

Source: LottieFiles Motion Tokens weather widget demo
